    "title": "Great places to use clamping tablet and phone mounts",
    "created_at": "2024-04-10T10:34:05-07:00",
    "body_html": "<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">iBOLT offers a wide variety of C-Clamp and claw type clamping mounts for every industry. Some common uses of these clamps are on wheelchairs, exercise equipment, poles or posts, bicycle or motorcycle handlebars and much more. In this article we will go over some of our favorite uses of these clamping style mounts and which type of clamp is best used in different situations.</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://iboltmounts.com/media/wysiwyg/clamp_mounts.png\" data-mce-src=\"https://iboltmounts.com/media/wysiwyg/clamp_mounts.png\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> </p>\n<table border=\"1\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<tbody data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<tr data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<td data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><a href=\"https://iboltmounts.com/multi-tablet-stand-ipad-point-of-sale-purchase-restaurant-triple-ibrt-34700\" data-mce-href=\"https://iboltmounts.com/multi-tablet-stand-ipad-point-of-sale-purchase-restaurant-triple-ibrt-34700\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://iboltmounts.com/media/wysiwyg/prod09-IBRT-34707.jpg\" data-mce-src=\"https://iboltmounts.com/media/wysiwyg/prod09-IBRT-34707.jpg\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></a></td>\n<td data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<h4 data-mce-fragment=\"1\">ON COUNTERTOPS, TABLES, AND KITCHENS</h4>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> Our Tablet Tower series is most commonly used as a table mount for point of sale and can hold from one to five different tablets. Fits tables, desks and countertops, that are 0.5” to 3” thick and is completely adjustable. Whether you are using one or 10 different tablets, we offer a variety of different Clamping mounts that are great for point of sale applications.</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Available Here:</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0818/5957/6100/files/prod01-IBRT-34700_1_480x480.jpg?v=1712359282\"></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><a href=\"https://iboltmounts.com/multi-tablet-stand-ipad-point-of-sale-purchase-restaurant-triple-ibrt-34700\" data-mce-href=\"https://iboltmounts.com/multi-tablet-stand-ipad-point-of-sale-purchase-restaurant-triple-ibrt-34700\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Three Tablet Holders</a></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0818/5957/6100/files/prod01-IBRT-34707_2_480x480.jpg?v=1712359475\"></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><a href=\"https://iboltmounts.com/multi-tablet-stand-four-ipad-holders-point-of-sale-purchase-restaurant-ibrt-34707\" data-mce-href=\"https://iboltmounts.com/multi-tablet-stand-four-ipad-holders-point-of-sale-purchase-restaurant-ibrt-34707\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Four Tablet Holders</a></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0818/5957/6100/files/prod01-IBRT-34705_1_480x480.jpg?v=1712359403\"></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><a href=\"https://iboltmounts.com/ibolt-tabdock-point-of-purchase-wall-mount-with-5-tablet-holders-perfect-for-multiple-delivery-applications-doordash-uber-eats-postmates-etc-fits-7-to-10-inch-tablets\" data-mce-href=\"https://iboltmounts.com/ibolt-tabdock-point-of-purchase-wall-mount-with-5-tablet-holders-perfect-for-multiple-delivery-applications-doordash-uber-eats-postmates-etc-fits-7-to-10-inch-tablets\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Five Tablet Holders</a></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> </p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<td data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><a href=\"https://amzn.to/3eImpiW\" data-mce-href=\"https://amzn.to/3eImpiW\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://iboltmounts.com/media/wysiwyg/prod06-IBBZ-33974.jpg\" data-mce-src=\"https://iboltmounts.com/media/wysiwyg/prod06-IBBZ-33974.jpg\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></a></td>\n<td data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<h4 data-mce-fragment=\"1\">ON POLES, POSTS, AND GYM EQUIPMENT</h4>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">The Bizmount Clamp is great for mounting onto a pole, post, or most gym equipment. Available in both a smartphone and tablet version, this mount is convenient for you to take on the go. Works with the following gym equipment, treadmills, eliplicaticals, spin bikes, pull-up bars, stationary bikes, and more.</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Available Here</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><a href=\"https://amzn.to/3faDPE4%3ETablet%20Version%3C/p%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href=\" data-mce-href=\"https://amzn.to/3faDPE4%3ETablet%20Version%3C/p%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href=\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Smartphone Version</a></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<td data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><a href=\"https://iboltmounts.com/ibolt-tabdock-accessibility-post-pole-rail-handlebar-mount-for-wheelchairs-exercise-equipment\" data-mce-href=\"https://iboltmounts.com/ibolt-tabdock-accessibility-post-pole-rail-handlebar-mount-for-wheelchairs-exercise-equipment\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://iboltmounts.com/media/wysiwyg/81QQx6JVLxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg\" data-mce-src=\"https://iboltmounts.com/media/wysiwyg/81QQx6JVLxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></a></td>\n<td data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<h4 data-mce-fragment=\"1\">ON WHEELCHAIRS, AND OTHER ACCESSIBILITY APPLICATIONS</h4>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Our accessibility wheelchair mounts are made for both smartphone and tablets and use our dual ball mourning system for full adjustability. Clamping mounts will fit on wheelchairs arm rest posts, or the lower poles near the wheels.</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Available Here:</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><a href=\"https://amzn.to/3faDPE4%3ETablet%20Version%3C/p%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href=\" data-mce-href=\"https://amzn.to/3faDPE4%3ETablet%20Version%3C/p%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href=\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Smartphone Version</a></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<td data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><a href=\"https://iboltmounts.com/tabdock-flexpro-clamp\" data-mce-href=\"https://iboltmounts.com/tabdock-flexpro-clamp\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://iboltmounts.com/media/wysiwyg/image010.jpg\" data-mce-src=\"https://iboltmounts.com/media/wysiwyg/image010.jpg\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></a></td>\n<td data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<h4 data-mce-fragment=\"1\">ON CARTS, STROLLERS, GOLF CARTS</h4>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">The TabDock FlexPro Clamp is a 12 inch gooseneck C-Clamp mount. The gooseneck is made out of strong aluminum that is flexible, but is also designed to stay in place which makes it great for carts, golf carts, strollers. Easily view your inventory, pick and pack orders, and easily view your inventory applications in one place.</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Available Here:</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><a href=\"https://iboltmounts.com/tabdock-flexpro-clamp\" data-mce-href=\"https://iboltmounts.com/tabdock-flexpro-clamp\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Tablet Version</a></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<td data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><a href=\"https://iboltmounts.com/tabdock-clamp\" data-mce-href=\"https://iboltmounts.com/tabdock-clamp\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://iboltmounts.com/media/wysiwyg/TabDock_clamp_artist.jpg\" data-mce-src=\"https://iboltmounts.com/media/wysiwyg/TabDock_clamp_artist.jpg\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></a></td>\n<td data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<h4 data-mce-fragment=\"1\">ON TABLES, DESK, AND WORKBENCHES</h4>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">The C-Clamp tablet holders are great for graphic or digital artists, education, or even just holding your tablet at home while you are cooking. Clamping mounts are great for not taking up a lot of counter space but being able to hold your tablet where you need it most. These tablet holders are great for at home and in person education.</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Available Here:</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><a href=\"https://iboltmounts.com/tabdock-clamp\" data-mce-href=\"https://iboltmounts.com/tabdock-clamp\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Tablet Version</a></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> </p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">There are always new ways we are coming up to use our products. The iBOLT Clamping Mounts are one of our most versatile non permanent mounting solutions. All tablet clamps are available to purchase here: and the smartphone versions are available<span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> </span><a href=\"https://iboltmounts.com/all-mounts/tablet-mounts/heavy-duty-c-clamp-mounts\" data-mce-href=\"https://iboltmounts.com/all-mounts/tablet-mounts/heavy-duty-c-clamp-mounts\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><b data-mce-fragment=\"1\">here.</b></a></p>",
